{{!-- Welcome Page Link template --}}
<div class="cl-welcome-link">
  <div class="cl-editor-wrap">
    <div class="cl-url-row">
      <code class="cl-url-display" data-action="copyLink" style="cursor:pointer;" title="Click to copy">{{welcomeUrl}}</code>
      <button type="button" class="cl-btn cl-btn--ghost cl-btn--icon" data-action="copyLink" aria-label="Copy link">
        <i class="fas fa-copy"></i>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cl-url-hint">
    <p>The default URL can be long. You can simplify it using a URL shortener service:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://tinyurl.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">TinyURL</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://bitly.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bitly</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="cl-foundry-notice">
    <p><strong>Foundry VTT 14.361+</strong> no longer serves HTML files from the Data folder — the welcome page will display as plain text unless you apply the patch included with this module.</p>
    <p>Full setup instructions:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/brunocalado/custom-login/wiki/Configurando-o-Custom-Login-para-o-Foundry-VTT" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instruções em Português</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/brunocalado/custom-login/wiki/Setting-Up-Custom-Login-for-Foundry-VTT" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instructions in English</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
